 furniture, brown recessed wall and seating)\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"comment\",\n      \"name\": \"hl_ps_reason\",\n      \"title\": \"Why did you choose these two? (preference to stay)\",\n      \"description\": \"High-luxury colour combination (dark brown, brown, ivory).\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"low_luxury_set\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"ll_pl_most\",\n      \"title\": \"Which store looks the most luxurious?\",\n      \"description\": \"Low-luxury colour combination (brown, orange, green). File ll_<letter>.jpg.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"O\",\n        \"text\": \"Store O (orange floor, green main wall and furniture, brown recessed wall and seating)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"P\",\n        \"text\": \"Store P (brown floor, orange main wall and furniture, green recessed wall and seating)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"Q\",\n        \"text\": \"Store Q (green floor, brown main wall and furniture, orange recessed wall and seating)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"R\",\n        \"text\": \"Store R (orange floor, brown main wall and furniture, green recessed wall and seating)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"S\",\n        \"text\": \"Store S (brown floor, green main wall and furniture, orange recessed wall and seating)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"T\",\n        \"text\": \"Store T (green floor, orange main wall and furniture, brown recessed wall and seating)\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"ll_pl_least\",\n      \"title\": \"Which store looks the least luxurious?\",\n      \"description\": \"Low-luxury colour combination (brown, orange, green).\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"O\",\n        \"tex